/-!
# Table of the rounded future costs, levels 1 to 7

For `1 ≤ h ≤ 7` and `0 ≤ J < 2^15` this file records the value `10^8 cf⁺_h(3^J)` of the
rounded future cost at the point `3^J`, as lane `J mod 256` (of width `32`) of the packed
number of index `⌊J / 256⌋` of level `h`. The values are certified by
`CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeSpec`.

## Main definitions

* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel1`: the packed values of level `1`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel2`: the packed values of level `2`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel3`: the packed values of level `3`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel4`: the packed values of level `4`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel5`: the packed values of level `5`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel6`: the packed values of level `6`.
* `CollatzPosDens.C3H17Values.nodeLevel7`: the packed values of level `7`.
-/

set_option linter.style.longLine false

@[expose] public section

